{{!
    @template block_coursecare/content

    Educational content of the CourseCare block: a decorative icon, the identity sentence and one
    line about the course file overview (Feature 002). The line holds at most one number, the files
    recorded by Moodle for the course, with the date of the analysis; its sentences come already
    translated from the diagnostic_line renderable. When a result exists, a link leads to the
    "Your course in numbers" page (Feature 003).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * diagnostic - optional object: with a result and files, "hasvolume", "volumelabel" and "volume"
      (the volume apart, to be seen at once); otherwise "sentences" (objects with "text"); then
      "date", "notes" (objects with "text") and, when a result exists, "overviewurl" and
      "overviewlink" (the link to the overview page)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "diagnostic": {
            "hasvolume": true,
            "volumelabel": "Course files recorded in Moodle",
            "volume": "6.0 MB",
            "sentences": [],
            "date": "Calculated on 16/10/26, 10:12.",
            "notes": [],
            "overviewurl": "https://example.com/blocks/coursecare/overview.php?id=4",
            "overviewlink": "Learn more about the files in your course"
        }
    }
}}
<div class="block_coursecare-content">
    <div class="block_coursecare-identity">
        <div class="block_coursecare-illustration">{{#pix}} sprout, block_coursecare {{/pix}}</div>
        <p class="block_coursecare-tagline mb-0">{{#str}} tagline, block_coursecare {{/str}}</p>
    </div>
    {{#diagnostic}}
    <div class="block_coursecare-overviewbox">
        {{#hasvolume}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-volumelabel mb-0">{{volumelabel}}</p>
        <p class="block_coursecare-volume mb-0">{{volume}}</p>
        {{/hasvolume}}
        {{#sentences}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-sentence mb-0">{{text}}</p>
        {{/sentences}}
        {{#date}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-date mb-0">{{date}}</p>
        {{/date}}
        {{#notes}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-note mb-0">{{text}}</p>
        {{/notes}}
        {{#overviewurl}}
        <p class="block_coursecare-overviewlink mb-0"><a href="{{overviewurl}}">{{overviewlink}}</a></p>
        {{/overviewurl}}
    </div>
    {{/diagnostic}}
</div>
